<title>USA: Prudential wins $50 mln Santa Clara USD, Calif.</title>
<headline>Prudential wins $50 mln Santa Clara USD, Calif.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities said it won $50 million of Santa Clara Unified School District (USD), Calif., general obligation bonds, election of 1997, Series 1997, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.016 percent.</p>
</text>
